    "detailed_description": "Pengun is a 3rd person shooting, defense, survivor game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe sick Santa Claus got Coronavirus, he's not able to send gifts in Christmas.<br />\r\nhe decided to send gifts through hot air balloons, these balloons often crashes in the<br />\r\nharsh Antarctica route, those spread the mass of garbage onto icebergs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPenguins decided to shoot down balloons and avenge the Santa.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContents:<br />\r\n- Nice anti-air guns including cool German Flak 88mm<br />\r\n- Enjoyable bullet hell from those automatic AA guns<br />\r\n- Boxes that might arise your curiosity<br />\r\n- Random items from boxes<br />\r\n- Cool level up and combo system<br />\r\n- Customizing penguin<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent Development: Beta, some of options are under construction.",
